{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.AlphaEmShiftMultiplicativeChain","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.AlphaEmShiftMultiplicativeChain","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaShiftTorus.AlphaShiftTorusKnot"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alpha_em_shift_chain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alpha_em_shift_chain","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L50-L71","doc":"**The multiplicative-chain identity.**\n\n  α_EM⁻¹ = q · [α_shift(T_{2,9})]_q · [α_shift(T_{3,5})]_q\n        = q · [9]_q · [10]_q.\n\nProof: the two `HasAlphaShiftTorus` instances supply\n`alphaShift 2 9 = 9 · (2 − 1) = 9` and `alphaShift 3 5 = 5 · (3 − 1) = 10`.\nSubstitution into the bare form is by definition.\n\nThis is a *theorem* (no conjecture beyond the witness-backed class\ninstances): every step is a named identity composed with another\nnamed identity.\n\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] prop:em-coupling-projection (the bare 1/α formula)\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] prop:alpha-shift-torus-knot (the closed-form α_shift)\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] prop:force-carrier-bring-uniqueness (the basis is exactly two knots)\n","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain","label":"prop:alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.bareIndices","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.bareIndices","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L46-L48","doc":"The bare-form indices fixed by prop:em-coupling-projection:\n`[9, 10]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.chainIndices","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.chainIndices","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L43-L44","doc":"The chain-form indices: `[alphaShift 2 9, alphaShift 3 5]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alphaEmInvIndices","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alphaEmInvIndices","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L38-L41","doc":"Abstract bare-form indexing for `α_EM⁻¹ = q · [9]_q · [10]_q`\nfrom prop:em-coupling-projection.  Concrete model: `[9, 10]`,\nmatching the `bareIndices` def below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.instReprQIntegerIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.instReprQIntegerIndex","kind":"instance","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.instReprQIntegerIndex.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.instReprQIntegerIndex.repr","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex.idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex.idx","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The numerical index `n` of the `[n]_q` q-integer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.qIntegerIndex","kind":"structure","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean#L30-L36","doc":"Abstract q-integer indexing.  Concrete model: a record carrying\nthe integer index `n` itself (so `qIntegerIndex n` records the\ntarget degree of the `[n]_q` q-integer being indexed). ","signatureChunk":0}]}